                "text": "It\u2019s Day 15 of the Republican shutdown \u2014 and week 3 of House Republicans out on vacation. \n\nWhile they\u2019re relaxing at home,\u00a0Californians are about to receive notices about huge increases in their health care premiums. @HouseDemocrats are here in Washington ready to reopen the government and fix the Republican health care crisis.\n\nIf you live in #CA44 and your premium is increasing, I WANT TO HEAR YOUR STORY: https://t.co/LInCrI1Bd5",
