                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Another day in Washington with Republicans STILL on vacation. We\u2019re on Day 16 of the Republican shutdown and they still refuse to work with Democrats to lower the cost of health care, while millions of Americans receive notices that their premiums will increase next year.\n\nOne thing is clear: @HouseDemocrats stand with the American people \u2014 we are ready to reopen the government and prevent health care costs from skyrocketing.",
