                "quoted_status_profile_username": "washingtonpost",
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Working Americans, including small business owners, their employees, and those who are self-employed, are under threat: MILLIONS will see their insurance premiums skyrocket because of the Republican health care crisis. \n\nRepublicans may be on their third week of vacation, but @HouseDemocrats stand with the American people and are ready to sit down RIGHT NOW to find a bipartisan agreement to reopen the government and protect affordable care.",
