                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Hardworking Americans across the country are receiving notices that their health care premiums will cost a lot more next year \u2014 for some, premiums may double or even triple. \n\nRepublicans would rather shut down the government, make public servants work without pay, and let healthcare premiums skyrocket than work with Democrats to address the health care crisis that they created and reopen the government.",
