                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans have been MIA from work. \n\nMeanwhile, premiums are set to skyrocket and cuts to Medicaid have put hospitals and clinics at risk of closing. Democrats are here, ready to work for the American people, reopen the government, and lower health care costs.",
