                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Americans have started to get notices that their health care premiums will double or even triple next year. @HouseDemocrats have been listening to your stories, holding hearings, and showing up for the American people. \n\nIt\u2019s Day 22 of the shutdown and Democrats are here ready to work to save health care\u2026where are House Republicans?",
