                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Republicans are not interested in solving the health care crisis they created. \n\n@HouseDemocrats have been ready, any time, any place to prevent higher health care premiums and reopen the government. But we can\u2019t do that until Republicans decide it\u2019s time to end their vacation.",
