                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our constituent George, who lives in #Paramount, gets care through Covered California for his health conditions that forced him to retire early. Saul\u2019s Covered California coverage helps take care of him, his wife, and their 10-year-old daughter in #SouthGate. \n\nAmericans across our district and around the country, like George and Saul, need Congress to extend the health care tax credits so they can continue to afford care. \n\n@HouseDemocrats stand with you \u2014 we\u2019ll take your stories to Washington and fight to address Republicans\u2019 health care crisis and reopen the government.",
