                "text": "Californians could see their annual premiums increase by thousands next year:\n\n\u2022Seniors may have to pay over $20,000 more.\n\u2022Families may have to pay almost $11,000 more.\n\u2022A 45-year-old may have to pay over $2,000 more.\n\nHealth care costs will skyrocket next year because Republicans refuse to work with @HouseDemocrats to reopen the government and extend the health care tax credits that keep costs low.",
