                "text": "Millions of Americans \u2014 including\u00a0many Californians \u2014 will be forced to pay THOUSANDS more in health care premiums next year.\n\nWorking Americans rely on health care tax credits to help keep coverage affordable for their families. Republicans need to join @HouseDemocrats to reopen the government, extend the tax credits, and lower costs.",
