                "text": "Trump and Republicans created a health care crisis in America. Senate Republicans\u2019 spending bill will let the health care tax credits expire, causing insurance premiums to skyrocket next year. \n\n@HouseDemocrats will fight this bill in the House because Americans deserve lower health care costs.",
