                "text": "Health care premiums will skyrocket in a few weeks because the tax credits that lower costs will expire. \n\nInstead of extending the health care tax credits, Republicans have proposed a \u201cplan\u201d that will raise health care costs and cause millions of Americans to lose coverage.\n\nTens of millions rely on these tax credits to afford health insurance. @HouseDemocrats will work in good faith to stop them from expiring and we will fight any Republican \u201cplan\u201d that raises costs or takes away coverage.",
