                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Americans should run as far and fast as they can from Republicans\u2019 health care plan, which fails to help Americans afford their health insurance coverage. \n\n@HouseDemocrats have a better option that would extend the tax credits for 3 years and help Americans afford their health care. Thank you to the 4 Republicans who have joined this effort. We welcome more. \n\nSpeaker Johnson should bring this bill to the House Floor IMMEDIATELY. Congress shouldn\u2019t go home for the holidays without first protecting health care for over 20 million Americans.",
